; Import-only Fluent journal. Run from an interchange output directory.
; Start Fluent as: fluent 3ddp -g -i interchange/fluent_import_check.jou
; This journal never initializes or iterates and deliberately does not save a mesh.

/file/import/cgns/mesh "bearing_prism.cgns"
/mesh/check-verbosity 2
/mesh/check
/report/mesh-size

; Inspect the transcript and compare every count/zone/extent/volume with
; interchange_report.json. Save bearing_prism_imported.msh.h5 manually only
; after all checks pass, or use fluent_import_check.py for the guarded save.
/exit yes
